---
import Wrapper from "./Wrapper.astro";
---


<Wrapper id="about">
		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
				<div>
					<div>
						<p class="text-muted font-mono text-base!">About me</p>
						<h2 class="mb-6">A bit of me</h2>
					</div>
					<div>
						<p class="mb-4">
							I'm a Full-Stack Engineer and AI Lead at Telus Digital, where I head a team of 12 building LLM-powered internal tools used across operations. Before stepping into that role, I spent time designing AI copilots for customer support and sales, and before that, shipping full-stack products at a software consultancy — from luxury travel platforms to emergency management apps for fire agencies.
						</p>
						<p class="mb-4">
							My day-to-day lives at the intersection of AI systems and software engineering — crafting system prompts, evaluation pipelines, and CI/CD workflows for LLM-based products, while staying hands-on with TypeScript, React, and Next.js on the frontend. I care a lot about building things that are reliable, well-documented, and maintainable at scale.
						</p>
						<p class="mb-4">
							Outside of product work, I've taught Git and async JavaScript at bootcamps for high school students, and I'm always thinking about how good engineering practices translate into better AI systems — and vice versa.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-8">
					<div>
						<h3 class="font-mono text-muted mb-3">FRONTEND</h3>
						<ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm">
							<li>TypeScript</li>
							<li>React</li>
							<li>Next.js</li>
							<li>Astro</li>
							<li>Tailwind</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="font-mono text-muted mb-3">BACKEND</h3>
						<ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm">
							<li>C#</li>
							<li>.NET</li>
							<li>MSSQL</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="font-mono text-muted mb-3">INFRASTRUCTURE</h3>
						<ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm">
							<li>Azure</li>
							<li>Docker</li>
							<li>Vercel</li>
							<li>GitHub Actions</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>
		
		</div>
		
</Wrapper>